/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 297 0 R
/E (The fundamental conclusion from the current crisis is that commodities markets are driven mostly by mobility limitations rather than resource shortages. This difference is essential. Production can often adjust, stockpiles may absorb short-term shocks, and new suppliers can arise. However, when the infrastructure connecting these units fails, the entire system lags.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
