/P 297 0 R
/E (Oil remains a market emphasis because it is visible, liquid, and can be valued promptly. However, the more serious disruption is taking place in less apparent areas: in shipping lanes that are no longer feasible, in chemicals that silently support industrial operations, and in supply)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
