/S /P
/P 302 0 R
/E (As of early 2026, these long-standing vulnerabilities have been dramatically exposed by the outbreak of the US-Israel war on Iran, which began on 28 February 2026. The conflict has triggered the largest single supply disruption in the history of the global oil and gas market, prompting analysts to call it the gravest energy shock of modern times.)
/Pg 13 0 R
