/P 317 0 R
/E (The Strait of Hormuz is only 21 miles wide at its narrowest point, yet it is the single most critical chokepoint for global energy supply. Approximately 20% of global oil supplies and significant LNG volumes transit this route daily.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [10]
>>
