132 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 317 0 R
/E (Since the start of the conflict, Iran has effectively blockaded the Strait. The amount of oil passing through has fallen to less than 10% of pre-war levels, according to reports citing AFP data. Around 200 tankers have been left stranded or redirected. Insurance companies, including Lloyd's of London, have responded by imposing war-risk exclusions on Gulf energy infrastructure, with war-risk premiums for Hormuz-transiting vessels multiplying tenfold.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [11]
>>
